{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":14,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-11-25","capabilities":{"tools":{"listChanged":false}},"serverInfo":{"name":"wsmcp","version":"devel"},"instructions":"WsMcp emulates the WonderSwan, the WonderSwan Color and the SwanCrystal. No machine runs until a cartridge is in: cart_load {path} puts one in, and emu_status says what runs. A frame is 1/75.47 s; video_screenshot shows the LCD. Addresses are linear, 0 to $FFFFF, or \"SSSS:OOOO\" strings; integers may be written as hex strings, \"0x1000\" or \"$1000\". The tools are the methods of docs/spec/control-protocol.md."}}
